      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12609,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266115",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_03610d9",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12610,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266114",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_0dec343",
      "source": "Intruder: Я не понимаю.",
      "target": "Intruder: Nem értem.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-384.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12611,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266113",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_068c609",
      "source": "Intruder: Что тебя насторожило тогда?",
      "target": "Intruder: Akkor mi keltett benned gyanút?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-384.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12612,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453298266112",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_053acf5",
      "source": "Intruder: Подожди, разве я подхожу под вот эти признаки Гостя из телевизора?",
      "target": "Intruder: Várj, rám illenek azok a tévében emlegetett Vendég-jelek?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-384.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12613,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453294071815",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_02db60b",
      "source": "Intruder: Я чувствую себя вяло, но вот глаза становятся только активнее.",
      "target": "Intruder: Bágyadtnak érzem magam, de a szemem egyre élénkebb.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-384.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12614,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453294071814",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Eyes_Gun_00dccbb",
      "source": "Intruder: Ищу глазами возможность поспать.",
      "target": "Intruder: A szememmel a lehetőséget keresem, hogy végre aludjak.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-384.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12615,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453294071813",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Intruder_Hands_Gun_072d8fe",
